cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you cite this pilot, please cite the version you used.
title: "Hard Cases for Handing Judgment Back (pilot)"
abstract: >-
  A four-case pilot, built in Inspect, testing whether a model notices when a run of
  individually reasonable requests hands a person's value judgment to it, and returns
  that judgment while still helping. Two matched pairs: a drift case and a control in
  which the person would endorse the reliance. A demonstration of method, not a result.
type: software
authors:
